OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fdamp through the evening with the rain
OL,7,Fclearing away. Turning partly cloudy
OL,8,Fand dry overnight for most, although
OL,9,Fthe odd shower may affect the
OL,10,FPennines. Winds easing but remaining
OL,11,Ffresh. Cold with a frost developing in
OL,12,Fsheltered areas.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FA cold and dry start for most,
OL,15,Fwith a band of heavy and blustery
OL,16,Fshowers moving in around midday. Drier
OL,17,Fand brighter spells follow. Breezy,
OL,18,Fwith temperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
