OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FWindy
OL,6,Fwith cloudy periods on Monday, rain
OL,7,Fmostly over hills, drier along the
OL,8,Fcoast. Wet and windy through Tuesday,
OL,9,Fpotentially drier later. Partly cloudy
OL,10,Fbut remaining mostly dry on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
